--- !u!114 &1096176677
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1096176674}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8e4bac2c3e79ab41ad043e1fc83c80e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Echoes.Runtime::Echoes.GardenKeeperInteractable
  prompt: Talk to Wren, the Garden Keeper
  range: 3
  interactionPoint: {fileID: 0}
  dialogue: {fileID: 2024002571}
  objective: {fileID: 1267533066}
  speaker: Wren, the Garden Keeper
  sleepingLines:
  - Shh... the garden is asleep. Nothing here will stir without clear water.
  - Wake the stream first, then come and find me. Mira will know how.
  offerLines:
  - Do you hear that? The stream is running! My roots have been waiting for this.
  - 'But a garden needs more than water. It needs something living to answer it:
    a fresh egg from Clover.'
  - Mix Chicken Feed from a Dawn Blossom at the workshop, feed her, and bring me
    the egg.
  offerWithEggLines:
  - Do you hear that? The stream is running! My roots have been waiting for this.
  - 'But a garden needs something living to answer it: a fresh egg from Clover.'
  - Wait... is that one of her eggs in your satchel already? Speak to me again and
    I will gladly take it.
  deliveredLines:
  - A fresh egg, still warm. Thank you.
  - I will tuck it under the old rose... and now, listen.
  - Oh! They are waking. Look at the beds!
  gardenLines:
  - Look at it! Every bed is singing.
  - The windmill on the north hill is next. Alder has been fretting over its beams
    all season.
  restoredLines:
  - The sails are turning! I can feel the whole garden swaying along with them.
  - Clover is laying like never before. It seems everything wants to sing.
